WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:04.708
Put AI to work on the process that's costing your team time.

00:04.958 --> 00:06.600
Your people know the job.

00:06.850 --> 00:08.491
They've tried the tools.

00:08.741 --> 00:13.554
Yet someone still has to chase the work, check the output and fix it.

00:13.804 --> 00:19.178
Cone Red brings the leadership and engineering to get an agreed workflow working inside your company.

00:19.428 --> 00:21.002
We start with one process.

00:21.252 --> 00:26.100
We review what you already use, choose the first change and build it with your team.

00:26.350 --> 00:28.321
Dima Levin leads the work.

00:28.571 --> 00:29.948
Our engineer builds.

00:30.198 --> 00:33.334
Your process owner checks and accepts the result.

00:33.584 --> 00:38.214
Before we build, we agree what good looks like and which business measure matters.

00:38.464 --> 00:41.612
Then we test the workflow and report what changed.

00:41.862 --> 00:44.449
Your team learns how to run and maintain it.

00:44.699 --> 00:51.383
We write handover conditions into the first agreement. You'll know what your owner needs to learn and when we can step back.

00:51.633 --> 00:54.546
Start with your free one-page AI work plan.

00:56.946 --> 01:01.492
Send us the process, the tools or agents you use, and where the work gets stuck.

01:01.742 --> 01:05.297
We'll send the page within three business days of a complete,

01:05.297 --> 01:09.376
usable brief. It names a first change, checks and a measure to watch.

01:09.626 --> 01:11.420
The page is yours to keep.

01:11.670 --> 01:12.784
No call required.

01:13.034 --> 01:16.234
Send us one process at cone dot red.
